$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrgsparlem1  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for dchrgspar: the shifted Gauss sum times its conjugate is the double sum of X ( b ) conj X ( c ) times the root of unity at A ( b - c ) (Lean hexpand in LConvexity gaussSum_mul_conj).

